==== inline ====
<p>Euler: <span class="math inline">$e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0$</span>, and <span class="math display">$$\int_0^1 x\,dx$$</span> in a line.</p>

----
document [1-1]
  paragraph [1-1]
    text [Euler: ]
    math [e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0]
    text [, and ]
    math display [\int_0^1 x\,dx]
    text [ in a line.]
==== not math ====
<p>$5 and $10. $2^n$ starts with a digit; <span class="math inline">${2^n}$</span> does not.
$ x$ and $x $ have spaces,
$x$ is escaped,
a formula $does not
cross$ a line, <code>$a$</code> is code, and <span class="math inline">$a `b` c$</span> is math.</p>

----
document [1-5]
  paragraph [1-5]
    text [$5 and $10. $2^n$ starts with a digit; ]
    math [{2^n}]
    text [ does not.]
    softbreak
    text [$ x$ and $x $ have spaces,]
    softbreak
    text [$x$ is escaped,]
    softbreak
    text [a formula $does not]
    softbreak
    text [cross$ a line, ]
    code [$a$]
    text [ is code, and ]
    math [a `b` c]
    text [ is math.]
==== backslashes ====
<p><span class="math inline">$a\$b$</span> and <span class="math inline">$\\$</span> and <span class="math inline">$\{x\}$</span></p>

----
document [1-1]
  paragraph [1-1]
    math [a\$b]
    text [ and ]
    math [\\]
    text [ and ]
    math [\{x\}]
==== display block ====
<span class="math display">$$\frac{a}{b}
  = c$$</span>
<span class="math display">$$  w$$</span>

----
document [1-8]
  math block [1-4] tex=[\frac{a}{b}\n  = c\n]
  math block [6-8] tex=[  w\n]
==== one line ====
<span class="math display">$$x = 1$$</span>
<p>$$$$</p>

----
document [1-3]
  math block [1-1] tex=[x = 1\n]
  paragraph [3-3]
    text [$$$$]
==== interrupts ====
<p>Before</p>
<span class="math display">$$x$$</span>
<p>after</p>

----
document [1-5]
  paragraph [1-1]
    text [Before]
  math block [2-4] tex=[x\n]
  paragraph [5-5]
    text [after]
==== containers ====
<blockquote>
<span class="math display">$$y$$</span>
</blockquote>
<ul>
<li>
<p>item</p>
<span class="math display">$$z$$</span>
</li>
</ul>

----
document [1-9]
  block quote [1-3]
    math block [1-3] tex=[y\n]
  bullet list [5-9]
    item [5-9]
      paragraph [5-5]
        text [item]
      math block [7-9] tex=[z\n]
==== unclosed ====
<p>$$
not closed</p>
<h1>Heading</h1>
<blockquote>
<p>$$
x</p>
</blockquote>
<span class="math display">$$ok$$</span>

----
document [1-9]
  paragraph [1-2]
    text [$$]
    softbreak
    text [not closed]
  heading [4-4]
    text [Heading]
  block quote [6-7]
    paragraph [6-7]
      text [$$]
      softbreak
      text [x]
  math block [9-9] tex=[ok\n]
==== table ====
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>f</th>
<th>g</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><span class="math inline">$a|b$</span></td>
<td><span class="math inline">$c$</span></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>

----
document [1-3]
  table [1-3]
    row [1-1]
      cell [1-1]
        text [f]
      cell [1-1]
        text [g]
    row [3-3]
      cell [3-3]
        math [a|b]
      cell [3-3]
        math [c]
==== math off ====
<p>Euler: $e^{i\pi}$ and $$x$$.</p>
<p>$$
y
$$</p>

----
document [1-5]
  paragraph [1-1]
    text [Euler: $e^{i\pi}$ and $$x$$.]
  paragraph [3-5]
    text [$$]
    softbreak
    text [y]
    softbreak
    text [$$]
==== render-block-html ====
-- block
<h1 id="a">A</h1>

-- block
<span class="math display">$$x$$</span>

-- block
<h1 id="a_1">A</h1>

-- block
<ul>
<li>p</li>
<li>q</li>
</ul>

the blocks make the document
